Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們家是從江戶時代起就經營至今的料理旅館
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有很多相親對象都會選擇我們這裡作為初次見面的地方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我和丈夫第一次見面也是在這裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那真是多謝惠顧了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.17,0:00:18.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,現在我就要去見未來的妻子了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.09,0:00:36.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真っ赤な線を描いたちっぽけな心の話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:43.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らの未来はどこに向かって光るの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:50.24,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,続きの線を描いた　色づいてしまう度にまぶしい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.36,0:00:55.70,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,そんな心のリズムを繋ぎだす
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:01:03.87,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしいかなしいかなしい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:09.92,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,うれしいうれしいうれしいうれしい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.62,0:01:16.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,２つの感情に揺さぶられては
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.31,0:01:24.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,まだ見ぬ指先を照らし出してくだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.38,0:01:31.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,このまま嘘でもいいから夢泳がせて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.17,0:01:37.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしい今を探してく
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.92,0:01:44.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らは見えない未来を信じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:50.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,だから悲しい悲しい今を探しては光った
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:51.59,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,引つかた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.71,0:01:55.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼這麼突然
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.46,0:01:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是挺好的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,俗話說得好 趁熱打鐵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.67,0:02:03.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已經替你向學校裡請假了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.91,0:02:03.99,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,萬歲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.27,0:02:07.50,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不愧是媽媽 思慮周全呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.64,0:04:32.97,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這個人終於等到這天了 高興得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.07,0:13:11.12,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以說接下來才是好戲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:13.69,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他一個人搞定了所有的對手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼辦 我向高崎同學告白以後
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.84,0:02:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還沒有和她好好談過
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我跟你說 我的相親對像好像長得很醜呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小根你在幹嘛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.57,0:02:21.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是小根嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:24.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你今天不是因為政府通知請假了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:29.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我又回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.12,0:02:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,畢竟我們還沒有結婚嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.54,0:02:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:39.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是來上課的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:44.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,學習固然重要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:47.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但將來的事更重要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:50.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不想後悔的話就好好幹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:55.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,後悔什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就是不想後侮所以才來學校的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:03.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在他們來接我之前趕緊逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:04.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島同學
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:06.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:12.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別出來 就在門後聽我說好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:14.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你今天為什麼要來學校
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.92,0:03:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的心意沒有改變
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:26.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不想和其她女孩子見面結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且還想和高崎同學你談談
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.35,0:03:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們再好好地談一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之前是我沒有說清楚所以才讓你產生誤會了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:48.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說過「就讓它變成美好回憶」的話了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.03,0:03:50.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這意思就是對我們倆來說已經過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.95,0:03:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以你現在的行為令我感到很困擾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.29,0:03:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:03:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明白了的話 就快去見你的相親對象吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.30,0:04:01.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:07.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之後的事情我記得不太清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是茫然地來到了這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫根島
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.14,0:04:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天還請多關照了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.35,0:04:19.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 不止是今天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:21.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以後也請多關照了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.33,0:04:22.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫真田
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.19,0:04:26.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今後也要請多關照了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.29,0:04:28.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哎呀 親家公哭了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:31.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想回家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:43.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈 你也快和他打個招呼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.09,0:04:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這個女孩就是我的結婚對像？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.51,0:04:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒想到除了高崎同學以外還有這麼漂亮的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:53.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我感到很困擾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 我已經...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.56,0:05:01.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:05.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我先自我介紹一下 我叫真田莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫根島
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,笨蛋 我們全家都叫根島啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這制服 是理城學院的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:17.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好厲害 那可是這附近最好的女子學校呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.67,0:05:22.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪裡哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.04,0:05:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這孩子從小就不服輸 總是拿第一呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:28.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第一?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:29.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪像我家這孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.91,0:05:32.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,直接就去了離家最近的學校
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.22,0:05:33.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家都是這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.72,0:05:34.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是哪所學校呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.81,0:05:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,春日山高中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那裡是我的母校
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的嗎 我也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.31,0:05:43.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 莉莉奈平時都參與了些什麼社團呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.23,0:05:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我加入了文學社
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.69,0:05:47.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,平常都沒有什麼活動
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:49.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏同學...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.37,0:05:55.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說 由佳吏同學
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:05:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真是太失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道你根本不在乎我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.05,0:06:08.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,畢竟我們素味平生 只是陌生人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.34,0:06:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的失禮之處在於你沒有盡力去瞭解他人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:16.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,甚至正眼也不瞧一眼 一直在發呆
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.97,0:06:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想考慮事情的話回家再考慮怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:23.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我絕對不要和你這種人結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.94,0:06:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:32.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我立刻去把她叫回來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.36,0:06:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不不 是我兒子的不對
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.37,0:06:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 讓我兒子去找她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.79,0:06:46.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:49.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果結婚的事可以就此告吹的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行 我怎麼又在考慮這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.09,0:06:56.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正如她所說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:06:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我太失禮了 又沒有常識
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.15,0:07:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別出聲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:22.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:27.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我嫁不出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:29.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要怎麼負起這個責任啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我就負起責任和你結婚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.97,0:07:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別說傻話了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:40.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,結婚什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,結婚什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管對象是誰 其本身就莫名其妙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.48,0:07:51.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很可怕 而且完全沒有實感
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.99,0:07:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和我一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:58.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管有沒有喜歡的人 想不想談戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.87,0:08:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也很害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是已成既定事實那也沒有辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.59,0:08:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我沒有逃跑帶著滿心的覺悟來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.38,0:08:13.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 你也太過分了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:18.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她沒有逃避來面對我了 可是我...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.01,0:08:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.68,0:08:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總之 我是絕對不會和你結婚的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.35,0:08:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.35,0:08:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也不用做到這地步吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.27,0:08:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且 頭要離地一公分
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.61,0:08:36.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這才是正確的下跪姿勢哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.49,0:08:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你明白就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:44.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不會再逼迫你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.54,0:08:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過 原來你也能好好說話的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.13,0:08:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為 不是你一直在說個不停嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.34,0:08:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我說話之前你不是就一直在發呆嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:04.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是因為 我已經有喜歡的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.22,0:09:07.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 今天早上她說她討厭我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.19,0:09:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我很失落
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喜歡的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:16.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和結婚對像說自己有別的喜歡的人是不是傻
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.49,0:09:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這件事 能詳細點告訴我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:23.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是這樣 我被她討厭了 結束
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好浪漫 像電視劇一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.01,0:09:38.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.01,0:09:41.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我問你 你喜歡那個高崎同學的哪裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.47,0:09:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有多喜歡她 喜歡到想要和她結婚的那種嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.01,0:09:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.72,0:09:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喜歡這種事不是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得不是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,應該是更自由更開心的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:58.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,光是在教室裡看著她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.65,0:10:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看著她的笑容就已經很幸福了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:02.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不明白啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:05.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以「喜歡」到底是什麼 怎麼回事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.41,0:10:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被她這麼一說...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.87,0:10:11.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,紐扣...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.29,0:10:15.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你對戀愛的話題這麼感興趣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:19.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 我是第一次和別人討論這種事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.97,0:10:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.18,0:10:23.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過 好奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.47,0:10:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.47,0:10:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學 態度忽然就改變了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得她是為了隱瞞什麼才說謊的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對吧 我會動搖也是很正常的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那都是你的一面之詞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.19,0:10:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以你會這麼想當然很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.66,0:10:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像是命運的紅線一般
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:52.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家都說政府通知就是科學的紅線
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:55.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是這紅線的另一頭竟然這麼主動
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:59.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說 如果由佳吏你不介意的話
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.30,0:11:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以幫你試探一下高崎同學的真心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:05.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才不會騙你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.64,0:11:08.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就這樣 我在未來的結婚對象的幫助下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.81,0:11:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打算去試探心上人的真心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.15,0:11:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回去以後要怎麼解釋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,假裝我們和好了不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.45,0:11:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 牽著手的話不會被追問了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,牽手...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是為了瞞過他們的話 我沒關係啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.01,0:11:48.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 我忽然覺得自己不是一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人成為我的同伴好像也不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.57,0:12:05.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 你的衣服紐扣一直開著
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.57,0:12:10.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎麼不早說啊 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:17.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,理城學院
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:19.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像是女子學校吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你去幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.34,0:12:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 政府通知的對象叫我過去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.59,0:12:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,騙人的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這不是很可愛嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:32.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,理學的女孩嗎 感覺跟我終生無緣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.68,0:12:35.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真好啊 小根你要和這女孩結婚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 還沒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.03,0:12:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎要看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小根政府通知的對象
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得你應該會想看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:49.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是不是誤會了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.14,0:12:52.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不太懂你什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.25,0:13:03.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然叫我來我就來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.63,0:13:05.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是從剛才開始就沒有回信
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底是怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:10.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和莉莉奈一樣的領結顏色
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.97,0:13:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個請問一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.81,0:13:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們認識二年級的真田嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真田嗎 誰來著
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.73,0:13:23.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是那個 絛蟲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.73,0:13:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什麼 真過分
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.46,0:13:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她體育課的時候身體不舒服 去醫務室了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,從這裡直走 盡頭的房間就是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.11,0:13:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,絛蟲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.10,0:13:40.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:45.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,請問真田同學在這裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.10,0:13:49.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.56,0:13:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.06,0:14:01.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎麼在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是你叫我來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 我睡著了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪裡不舒服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.70,0:14:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,輕微中暑而已
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.40,0:14:11.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,睡一覺就會好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.03,0:14:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要換衣服 你能先出去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:25.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈 有人叫你絛蟲嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你從誰那裡聽說的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.93,0:14:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,從誰那裡聽說的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.97,0:14:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖次
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖次怎麼可能會說話呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.97,0:14:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,反正就是從二年級的學生那裡聽到的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.10,0:14:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還是說真的是胖次告訴你的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是誰的胖次說的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:43.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈 冷靜一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.79,0:14:50.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不穿裙子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.07,0:14:54.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小時候 我因為生病一直在住院
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.03,0:14:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,現在已經痊癒了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.20,0:15:01.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是是非常難以治癒的病
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.71,0:15:07.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我到了初一的第二學期才開始正常上學
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是女生有各自的世界和規則對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.30,0:15:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我沒法融入她們的團體
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:21.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 你是年級第一吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.31,0:15:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以這為契機和她們打好關係怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.23,0:15:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就因為我沒有朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.69,0:15:27.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被她們說三道四的讓我很煩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.57,0:15:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不想輸給她們才拚命學習
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.07,0:15:31.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.65,0:15:36.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正因如此 現在更不知道該怎樣相處了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.07,0:15:40.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,結果就被人叫做絛蟲了 明白了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:42.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然不太懂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也是說 莉莉奈比起其她女生來說不太擅長社交對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.21,0:15:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是那樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.42,0:15:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我認為我只是單純的不會看氣氛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.67,0:15:55.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原來如此 我也是那樣覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.14,0:16:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.93,0:16:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總覺得 我能正常的和莉莉奈說話呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.06,0:16:12.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是 我不太擅長和女生說話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:15.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,完全不知道她們在想什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:19.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但這點莉莉奈不同
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.28,0:16:21.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你動不動就發火什麼都直說 我覺得反而輕鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:25.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不妙 我是不是說錯話了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:29.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還是第一次有人對我說這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.09,0:16:35.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 你現在就能和我無障礙交流
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.76,0:16:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就像這樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 你又不是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.14,0:16:44.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是朋友 但也不是戀人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.06,0:16:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們之間到底算什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.81,0:16:51.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,算了 不說了 先離開這裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天快要黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.91,0:16:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.07,0:17:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒事的 我完全沒看到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:06.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,條紋 蕾絲什麼的 我真的一點都沒看見
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.33,0:17:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說回來 為什麼突然叫我過來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.13,0:17:16.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然問為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:21.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,當然是因為我想聽你和高崎同學的戀愛故事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:23.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.06,0:17:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這之前只是簡單的說了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.56,0:17:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一直想知道細節
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:32.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在公園告白的時候到底是怎樣的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.57,0:17:37.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說 你在聽嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.15,0:17:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.91,0:17:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個中長髮的女孩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.95,0:17:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼會在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.71,0:17:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:52.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是高崎美咲同學嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.29,0:17:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,初次見面，我叫真田莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.97,0:18:00.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是根島由佳吏政府通知的對象
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.43,0:18:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個雖說是他政府通知的對象
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.43,0:18:10.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但和由佳吏才剛認識不久
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.31,0:18:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,更談不上說喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.61,0:18:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不喜歡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,相比那個我更想問你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.07,0:18:21.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你現在對根島由佳吏怎麼看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:26.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼看待根島同學嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.71,0:18:33.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,該從何說起才好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.13,0:18:35.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.71,0:18:40.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我喜歡他後腦勺的發旋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:41.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,發旋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.89,0:18:46.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也許是因為座位在後面能夠隨時看到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.26,0:18:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還有那種帶溜肩又帶點駝背的感覺也很好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.64,0:18:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,遠遠一看就知道是他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.10,0:18:55.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還有 上課時明明沒有回答的自信還亂舉手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.56,0:18:58.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被老師點到 嚇一跳的樣子也很可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.11,0:18:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:01.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等 等 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:02.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是在說些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.74,0:19:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是問根島同學的魅力所在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.37,0:19:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所在就是發旋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.95,0:19:10.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原來高崎同學 是這樣看我的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.87,0:19:11.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已經十分瞭解他的魅力點了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 其實根本不瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.75,0:19:20.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我明白了 我想問的是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:21.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你喜歡根島由佳吏的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.38,0:19:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 我好開心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.13,0:19:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我到現在為止一直藏在心裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:29.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像這樣第一次和別人聊起這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.06,0:19:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的讓我很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.60,0:19:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 可以的話能再聽我說說根島同學的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:44.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,從小學開始 我的記憶裡一直有高崎同學的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.74,0:19:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原來我也有好好存在高崎同學的記憶裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:20:00.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喜歡一個人 真是美好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.63,0:20:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也讓我聽聽莉莉奈的意見吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:06.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你覺得根島同學的哪裡比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.84,0:20:10.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我現在怎麼知道這種事情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.43,0:20:17.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明明自己都顧不過來 還對別人溫柔的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:24.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個如果願意的話能再一起玩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.07,0:20:27.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為今天太過開心了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.41,0:20:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.49,0:20:33.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你 我會給你發信息的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.71,0:20:38.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒被發現真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.25,0:20:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.47,0:20:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎麼哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.84,0:20:51.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我第一次交到了朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.85,0:20:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 她沒說我們是朋友 所以是熟人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.39,0:20:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總之 我好開心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.98,0:21:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這是朋友啊 大概
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.53,0:21:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:06.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.53,0:21:08.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.91,0:21:11.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看她哭成這樣 我實在是沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.66,0:21:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我心跳好快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:17.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是不是喜歡上高崎同學了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.25,0:21:21.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可能 不可能 那絕對是錯覺
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.00,0:21:22.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.17,0:21:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 你想和高崎同學接吻之類的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.59,0:21:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是呢 這倒還是沒有的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果接吻了心裡也不會覺得很滿足吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.72,0:21:38.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你和高崎同學接吻了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.69,0:21:42.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個該怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,該說是很多的思念一下子爆發了出來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.90,0:21:50.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是那是政府通知來之前
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.16,0:21:53.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想到一個好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.79,0:21:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏 你去和高崎同學再接一次吻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.38,0:22:26.16,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,さっきの言葉はまだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.16,0:22:28.69,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I can't say I want to say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.69,0:22:30.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,言えないままでしまってる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.77,0:22:33.05,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I always lie
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.05,0:22:35.34,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,星の瞬きほど早く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.34,0:22:37.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,願い事するひまも無く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.77,0:22:39.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,短い夏が終わってく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.91,0:22:42.73,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I can't say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.73,0:22:45.62,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Heart beat sound
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.62,0:22:51.62,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,気づかないでいてね高鳴る鼓動
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.62,0:22:55.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Can't keep it to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.58,0:22:58.43,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自然にこぼれたはにかむ顔が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.43,0:23:04.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,隠せないメッセージ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.76,0:23:06.59,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I know why I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.59,0:23:09.05,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,未来を重ねた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.05,0:23:13.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,二人の温もりが ここに残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:15.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,ありふれた日々に
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.75,0:23:18.35,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,はじまりのキスを
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.35,0:23:33.90,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,ひとりの夜は 君の夢を見てた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.39,0:23:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真田同學 你要點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.97,0:23:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.39,0:23:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下回 被忽略的戀情
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.18,0:23:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,菜單上的「免費微笑」是什麼東西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.09,0:00:36.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下等待的長線 這是心中小小的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:43.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們的未來 到底會走向何方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:50.24,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下連續的長線 接下來的旅途必定也耀眼奪目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.36,0:00:55.70,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣 連接上心的旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:01:03.87,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷 悲傷 悲傷和悲傷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:09.92,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}快樂 快樂 快樂和快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.62,0:01:16.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}把兩份感傷的心疊放在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.31,0:01:24.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}看不清的未來裡誰才是該出場的配角
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.38,0:01:31.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣下去 即使是謊言也讓我把這美夢做完吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.17,0:01:37.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 現在就去尋找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.92,0:01:44.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們相信著看不見的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:50.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 去尋找著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:51.59,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}現在就去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.38,0:22:26.16,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剛才想說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.69,0:22:30.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還沒能說出口
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.05,0:22:35.34,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,時間轉瞬即逝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.34,0:22:37.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,無暇許下心願
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.77,0:22:39.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,短暫夏日就此結束
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.62,0:22:51.62,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別讓他發現 心聲難以克制
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.58,0:22:58.43,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自然流露的靦腆表情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.43,0:23:04.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,掩藏不住心意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.59,0:23:09.05,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,兩人的溫度
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.05,0:23:13.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,歷經歲月 停留在此
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:15.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在平淡的日子裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.75,0:23:18.35,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,時常回想起我們第一次的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.35,0:23:33.90,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孤獨的夜裡 在夢中與你相會
